Package: narrivy
Version: 1.0.0~rc1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Waqar Gulzar <iamwaqargulzar@gmail.com>
Description: Narrivy — local-first voice dictation for Linux
 Fast, private dictation that runs locally on your machine.
 Uses PipeWire for capture and local Whisper ASR via transcribe.cpp
 and capability-driven delivery without cloud by default.
Depends: libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0 (>= 2.44), libgtk-3-0t64 (>= 3.24) | libgtk-3-0 (>= 3.24), libgtk-layer-shell0 (>= 0.8), libopenblas0, pipewire, systemd, xdg-utils
Recommends: pipewire-pulse, wtype, libglib2.0-bin
Homepage: https://github.com/iamwaqargulzar/narrivy
